end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the solution must have $b = 3$. However, we still need to find $a$. To do this, we substitute $b = 3$ back into one of the equations. Let's choose the first equation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n2a + 5b &= 19 \\\\\n2a + 5(3) &= 19 \\\\\n2a + 15 &= 19 \\\\\n2a &= 4 \\\\\na &= 2\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution to the system of equations is $a=2, \\,b=3$, which can be expressed as $(2,3)$." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["6b8157cd-7759-5311-a70d-1e44f2700470"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "generator" :question-generator/id #uuid "a2ef49f5-dfc4-5fb1-b890-7cb7bc96039a" :question-generator/script "generate/scratch/17592186192656.py"} [:db/add 17592186192656 :knowledge-point/question-generator "generator"] {:db/id 17592186192656 :knowledge-point/questions ["7b0730ae-94df-51c2-9122-80a657d5c130" "d400f619-bf7d-5b12-8de8-ccc69c639d78" "a75817b8-4e26-5edd-a706-c4d036e41293" "cd3b4b3f-b020-5169-9586-17768134232d" "9719f6ce-a725-5fda-8dba-4e72f19011f6" "02c41293-f116-502f-be60-22954dd650e1" "d579d3ab-2a4e-5b62-a685-7b2b44091ebf" "66c662cf-af7a-5ce7-907d-2fc15145c8ec" "3848697a-49af-57cf-80a1-3aeaa90cbfd0" "3584fccc-ff52-560b-affb-117ca9035e1b" "b3065a5a-e33d-5a8d-955c-b55d1f00fd62" "c26af310-f3be-5785-a8b6-74feb81edc70" "258cf739-9da3-523a-9e45-9eb6c6ac19c9"]} [:db/ensure 17592186192656 :knowledge-point/validate]]
